.TH EZYVIEW 1 "23 October 2026" "EzyView 0.3.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ezyview \- open-source charting and trading terminal
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ezyview
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B EzyView
is a desktop trading terminal built on Tauri and WebKitGTK. It provides
charts, indicators, drawing tools, a Pine Script editor, paper trading, a
trading journal, market research panels and an optional connection to a local
MetaTrader 5 bridge.
.PP
The application stores its workspace, journal, crash log and MCP snapshot in
.IR $XDG_DATA_HOME/com.printezy247.ezyview
(usually
.IR ~/.local/share/com.printezy247.ezyview ).
Provider API keys and MT5 passwords are kept in the operating system keyring,
not in that folder.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B WEBKIT_DISABLE_DMABUF_RENDERER=1
Disable the WebKitGTK DMA-BUF renderer on drivers that produce a blank window
or a crash. The same effect is available from Settings under Desktop.
.TP
.B WEBKIT_DISABLE_COMPOSITING_MODE=1
Disable accelerated compositing as a last-resort graphics workaround.
.TP
.B EZYVIEW_MT5_TOKEN
Shared token the optional MetaTrader 5 bridge requires on every request.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/lib/EzyView/mcp/ezyview-mcp.mjs
The stdio MCP server. It needs Node.js 22 or newer.
.TP
.I /usr/lib/EzyView/mt5-bridge/bridge.py
The optional MetaTrader 5 REST bridge (requires a Windows Python installation
with the MetaTrader5 package inside the Wine prefix).
.SH SEE ALSO
The project home page at
.IR https://github.com/printezy247/EzyView .
.SH BUGS
Report bugs at
.IR https://github.com/printezy247/EzyView/issues .
